  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p>
    The preferred contact method is email at
    <a href="mailto:armand.salle@gmail.com">armand.salle@gmail.com</a>. I am
    based in Angers, France and work remote first. I can also collaborate
    regularly with teams in Paris.
  </p>

  <h2>What to include</h2>

  <p>
    The best fit is a focused conversation about a product with real operational
    complexity, a senior product engineering mission, or an early team where
    engineering will help define the product. A useful first message includes
    the problem being solved, the current team, the expected scope, the working
    location, and the likely timeline.
  </p>

  <p>
    I am most useful when a team needs strong TypeScript and React execution,
    product ownership, internal tooling, workflow design, architecture that can
    evolve, reliable delivery practices, or thoughtful use of AI inside an
    engineering workflow.
  </p>

  <h2>Responsible contact</h2>

  <p>
    Recruiting messages and project introductions are welcome when they contain
    enough context to assess the fit. Please do not submit sensitive personal
    data, credentials, production data, or confidential customer information
    through email.
  </p>

  <p>
    You can also verify my public work through
    <a href="https://github.com/armandsalle">GitHub</a>,
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/armand-sall%C3%A9-9550a613a/"
      >LinkedIn</a
    >, and <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/armand-salle.bsky.social"
      >Bluesky</a
    >.
  </p>
